ic0.anpoimages.com/wordpress%2Fwp-content%2Fauthors%2F69cd4b31b89f4-WhatsApp%20Image%202026-04-01%20at%2010.11.24%20PM.jpeg?fit=crop&w=90&h=90\" alt=\"4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\">\n                                    </picture>\n                                </a>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <div>\n                                                                                \n                                    \n                \n                                                                                                                                    <p>发布于 2026 年 8 月 10 日，美国东部时间凌晨 1:21</p>\n                                    \n                                \n                \n            </div>\n                                            \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n        </div>\n\n\n            <a id=\"login-button-article-sidebar\">\n            <p>登录您的 Android Police 帐户</p>\n            \n        </a>\n                \n                        \n            \n                                                            \n                                            \n                \n                \n                \n            \n            \n\n        \n                        \n        \n                                                                                            \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n                                                                        \n                                    \n        \n                                                \n                                                                                                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                                                    \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                                                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                                                                \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                                                                                                \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n                                                \n                        \n                        \n                                    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                    \n                    \n                        \n    \n    \n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n                        \n        \n        \n                        \n\n        \n        \n        \n                \n                    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                \n                    \n                    \n    \n    \n        \n                \n                    \n                                    \n\n\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n                                        <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! -->\n\n                \n<div itemprop=\"articleBody\" id=\"article-body\"><p>它最初是谷歌实验室内的一个实验项目，后来成为谷歌最受欢迎的人工智能产品之一。 它变得足够大，以至于 Google 将其官方名称从 NotebookLM 更改为 Gemini Notebook，以使 Gemini 品牌受益。</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><p>品牌重塑后，笔记本电脑的体验没有发生重大变化，但这家山景城科技巨头不断致力于新的想法来改善整体体验。 我们刚刚听到的最新消息也许值得标记为自首次亮相以来最重大的变化之一。</p>    <p>Testcatalog 在 Studio 面板中发现了一个名为“App”的新图块，根据 Google 给出的描述，它可以帮助您根据源材料创建应用程序。</p>    <p>Testcatalog 还为我们提供了该功能的屏幕截图，根据我们所看到的内容，它将接受用户的提示来生成应用程序。 例如，用户只需在文本字段中输入内容并点击“生成”按钮即可创建有趣的游戏或可视化仪表板。</p>    \n                \n    \n    \n    \n                \n    \n                \n                \n                \n        \n                                                            \n                                                                                                                        \n                            \n    \n    \n\n    \n    <div data-img-url=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg\" data-modal-id=\"single-image-modal\" data-modal-container-id=\"single-image-modal-container\" data-img-caption=\"&quot;Testingcatalog&quot;\">\n                                                                                            <figure><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 480px)\" data-srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=500&dpr=2\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=500&dpr=2\">\n        <source media=\"(max-width: 767px)\" data-srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=800&dpr=2\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=800&dpr=2\">\n        <source media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\" data-srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=825&dpr=2\" srcset=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=825&dpr=2\">\n        <img width=\"1650\" height=\"928\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"App-tile-Gemini-notebook\" data-img-url=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=825&dpr=2\" src=\"https://static0.anpoimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/app-tile-gemini-notebook.jpg?q=49&fit=crop&w=825&dpr=2\">\n        </picture><small>Credit:&#160;Testingcatalog</small></figure>\n            \n        </div>\n<p>尽管没有明确的证据，但这可能仅适用于其高级级别。 即使谷歌确实计划将其置于付费墙后面，也不清楚“应用程序”图块何时可供用户使用。</p>    <!-- No AdsNinja v10 Client! --><h2 id=\"gemini-notebook-is-working-on-two-additional-new-features\">Gemini Notebook 正在开发另外两项新功能</h2>\n<p>除了“应用程序”磁贴之外，Gemini Notebook 还被发现正在开发一个按钮，允许用户手动添加注释。 另外，还有另一个功能可以让人工智能为用户生成注释。</p>    <p>这两者应该能够很好地互补。 虽然人工智能起草的笔记可以快速将来源转化为有用的笔记，但创建自己的笔记的能力可以为您提供更多控制权，因为您可以根据需要手动添加更改。</p>    \n\n                \n<p>此外，水印切换功能也在开发中。 目前还没有足够的信息说明它的具体用途，但它的设计似乎是为了让用户控制人工智能生成的品牌是否出现在导出的视频、幻灯片和信息图表上。</p>    <p>同样，谷歌何时推出这些功能尚不清楚。 然而，泄密事件强烈表明该公司可能正处于开发的最后阶段。 如果是这样的话，我们可以预期所有这些功能都将很快为用户提供。</p>    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n    \n    \n        \n                        \n                \n        \n        \n\n                    \n                        \n    \n\n\n            \n                                \n        \n        \n    \n\n        \n    </article>\n\n    \n            \n        </div></div>"}